The meshes under models/myagv_mycobot/meshes/ come from Elephant Robotics,
see LICENSE in this directory for both licenses.

The myAGV and adaptive gripper meshes are shared with the myagv_mecharm robot
and live in CustomRobots/myagv_mecharm/models/myagv_mecharm/meshes/, see the
NOTICE in that directory for their origin.

joint1_pi and joint2 to joint7 were converted to STL in meters from
the myCobot 280 Pi meshes in
https://github.com/elephantrobotics/mycobot_ros2 (mycobot_description),
Copyright (c) 2020 Elephant Robotics, BSD-2-Clause.

The arm and gripper joint origins, axes and limits in
myagv_mycobot_common.urdf.xacro follow mycobot_280_pi_adaptive_gripper.urdf
from the same source. The driving gripper joint is renamed from
gripper_controller to gripper_base_to_gripper_left3 because ros2_control
cannot activate a controller named like one of its joints. The laser and
camera frames follow the myAGV bringup in
https://github.com/elephantrobotics/myagv_ros (myagv_odometry).

Everything else in this directory is original work for RoboticsAcademy.
